WEBVTT

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:37.780
Mr. Volkov's proposed pro Beyblade
league is creating buzz all around the world.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:41.780
Many people seem to have
interest in the idea of going pro,

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:46.660
but people who know about
Mr. Volkov's past have their doubts.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.130
Volkov!

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:06.600
It wouldn't be strange to say that Japan's Takao
Kinomiya has set a big precedent for Mr. Volkov.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:10.190
They got us...

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:12.150
Is this how it's
going to end?

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:17.820
I didn't think they'd go so far
as to report Takao's pro debut...

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.160
It's like you're one
of Volkov's pawns.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.410
One of his pawns?
That's not funny!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.210
Well, what are
you going to do?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.790
Are you gonna join
Volkov's pro league? Or not?

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.630
A-about that...

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.880
What's a pro?

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:37.510
Are you gonna
become a pro-thing?

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.590
Are pros cool?
Are they strong?

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.760
Then I wanna
become one too!

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.890
You know, it must be nice to be a pro when you think about it.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:54.230
Right? It's cool to think that
Beyblade could have a pro league!

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:56.230
But what about this guy?

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:58.280
He was a bad guy, right?

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:03.240
You're right, Volkov's
a real nasty one...

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:05.790
But pros have a nice
ring to it, you know?

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.950
A real nice ring to it!

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:13.670
But Volkov is a man who once tried to use Beyblading to his own benefit.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:16.710
What are you
gonna do, Takao?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.300
What will you do, Takao?

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.010
What's it gonna be, Takao?

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:22.090
What are you
going to do, Takao?

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:30.270
Forget it! I don't even know
what I'm supposed to do!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.070
Garland.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:43.950
Publishing Takao Kinomiya's pro debut has
proven to be more effective than expected.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:48.240
We have a flood of new
applicants from all over the world.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.870
The numbers aren't
what's important.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.120
It's the level of
the applicants.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:56.880
But Takao Kinomiya has been more useful than I would have thought.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:00.630
Because he's the
world champion, after all.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.380
Beybattles can't
be played alone.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:08.260
An exciting Beybattle can only be
had with an opponent of equal skill.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.560
There shouldn't be
any problems with that.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.520
With you, and one other
in the BEGA League.

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:15.190
Brooklyn, of course.

00:04:16.060 --> 00:04:17.230
Indeed.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:22.200
A battle with him has the potential to
surpass any other in Beyblade history.

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:25.160
Where is he now?

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.820
Beats me.

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:29.950
He's the type you
can't keep on a leash.

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:38.170
Hey, Max...

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.170
What do the guys at the PPB
think about the pro league?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:48.180
When I asked my mom, she said
that they mostly wanted to join it.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:53.350
But they don't know if they
can trust Volkov or not.

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.020
That figures...

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.690
We all came to
the same conclusion.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:01.440
Going pro sounds nice, but...

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:06.030
The question still stands on
whether or not we can trust Volkov.

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.950
Yeah.

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:10.990
And everyone else
feels the same way.

00:05:11.370 --> 00:05:13.700
I wonder what
Rei and Kai think.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.170
It'd be reassuring to have
those two here with us.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.590
Mr. Kinomiya! Is it true
that you're going pro?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.720
Who do think think you are,
barging in on us like that!

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.930
Now, now...

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:30.220
If you're really going to
become a professional,

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.470
then please, consider signing a
sponsor contract with us!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.930
A sponsor?

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.730
A contract?!

00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:40.360
Max, we'd love for you to appear in a
mayonnaise ad with our company!

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.820
Oh! A mayonnaise ad?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:47.820
If you sign with us, we will
provide all your parts and repairs,

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.570
and a down payment, of course!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.910
Is this what it means
to become a pro?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.790
What's a suppon-sir?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.540
Haven't you ever
had suppon before?

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:01.210
It's reeeeally good!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:04.260
Daichi! Please sign a
contract with us too!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.380
Me?! Can I eat
this suppon stuff too?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.930
I wanna try suppon!

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.100
Wonder what it's like!

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:13.600
Unacceptable!

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.560
Who th'hell are you?

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:17.560
Excuse us...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:20.020
W-we are Takao's--

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.440
You've entered into my
sacred dojo without permission!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:29.950
Or, perhaps you've come to get a taste of my harmless full-contact sword style?

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:33.120
O-oh, not at all, sir...

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:36.870
No holding back, now! Let me
show you newcomers a move or two!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:40.040
Please, listen to--

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.040
And stay out!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.670
Why do I have to...

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:50.300
Grandpa!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.680
We didn't invite them here...

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.850
Unacceptable!

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.060
Who they were
isn't the point.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.600
As it stands right now,
you kids are the problem.

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.860
What did we do?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.690
Hear me out.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.190
You should be ashamed, Takao.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.450
Worrying if you're going
to go pro or not...

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:13.780
If you're a real man, you'd make
a decision and stand by it!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.080
Um, but I'm a girl, so...

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.500
Fools!!

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.870
But we're stuck halfway
between two sides!

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:27.340
Even so! You won't get anything done by
wasting your time and dragging your feet!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:30.800
Run straight on at your problem
until you're happy with the solution!

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.800
Easier said than done...

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:41.560
I don't know about these tops, but don't you have someone close who you can ask advice?

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:43.810
That would be...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:46.150
Takao's brother, right?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:49.360
Why didn't we figure
that out sooner?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.780
That's it!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.370
Our coach, my brother would know!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:57.620
He can tell us
what we should do!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.540
Yeah! Good idea!

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.420
Then let's go find him!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.180
Do you mind sharing some
of that feed with me, sir?

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:27.020
Take as much
as you'd like.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.000
Thanks.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.660
Do you like birds?

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.790
I like them.

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:41.900
They can fly in the
sky, free as can be.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.170
I agree. The sky is great.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.880
Compared to the birds, I'm...

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.180
Who are you...?

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.230
Dang!

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:15.070
Where'd my bro go
at a time like this?

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.110
Is he really around here?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:20.200
He comes here a lot, so...

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:25.370
It's weird he hasn't shown up,
especially with the BBA's situation.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:29.280
Either way, let's search
around here as much as we can!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.260
He's not over there.
How's your side going?

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:36.180
Not here either.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.720
And Daichi...

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.640
Not there...

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:44.060
My brother's not a bug!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.140
For crying out loud...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.730
Man, I wonder
where he went?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:48.480
Kinomiya.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.150
Yuriy!

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.320
Sergey, and Boris too!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:55.650
What do you want?

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.070
What are you doing here?

00:09:58.570 --> 00:10:01.030
If you wanna battle,
I'm ready any time!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.700
Just a coincidence.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:05.980
See you.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.540
Wait up, Yuriy!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.290
You know about
it too, right?

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.540
About Volkov?

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.250
I don't know what to do!

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:16.420
Or if we can really trust him.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:19.090
If I should really
become a pro...?

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.180
Kinomiya...

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.510
No, that's not just it.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.810
There's something
pulling at my gut!

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:29.060
I can't put my finger on it,
but I know something's wrong!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:30.940
There's no need
to hesitate!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.150
He's right.

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:35.990
We're going to go crush
Volkov's pro league ourselves.

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:40.740
Which means that you don't need
to worry about Volkov or going pro.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:46.200
If you're hesitating,
then listen to your gut feeling.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.660
Guys...

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:53.000
For the record, we're not going for
some petty reason like revenge.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:57.380
We've just got business to settle
with Volkov, once and for all.

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.880
Business to settle...

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.340
With Volkov...

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:04.260
But before we do,
I'm glad we met.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.640
Wait! We're coming too!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:07.600
Don't!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.520
This is between Volkov and us!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.270
We don't want
you getting involved.

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:17.570
We cannot allow Volkov to be
forgiven for what he has done!

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.530
No. We will
never forgive him!

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:23.370
Yuriy...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:31.830
Takao...

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.130
Should we let them go?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.670
They're going to BEGA then.

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:37.590
Takao...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.760
Yeah, I know!

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:44.180
Dammit, Hitoshi!
Where the heck is he?!

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:58.940
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.790
Who are you?!

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:14.080
Stop--

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:15.380
Volkov!

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:16.920
Where are you?!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.590
Mr. Volkov isn't--

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:19.710
Move it or lose it!

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:26.100
Well, well!
I was expecting you three.

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:26.930
Volkov!

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:31.890
Yuriy Ivanov.
How long has it been?

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:34.900
I see you
haven't forgotten me.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.190
How wonderful.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.190
Bastard!

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.650
You sleaze!

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.280
Stop.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:45.030
If I could forget about
you I would, Volkov!

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:48.160
You're here about the
BEGA League, correct?

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:53.120
If you're going to join, it
would be sure to stir things up.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.290
Piss off!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.420
Just the opposite!

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:59.630
I'm putting an end to the BEGA
League before it gets off the ground!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:06.550
As long as you're associated with
Beyblading, it'll bring nothing but disaster!

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.760
We cannot allow that!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:12.560
No forgiveness, even after
I've long since apologized?

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:17.440
Obviously! Did you forget
what you did to us?!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:21.030
Bring out all
of your members!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.070
We'll beat them all.

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:26.950
Or is this just a
daycare for wimps?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.040
I suppose there's
no other option.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:35.000
A battle is the only way
we can settle this.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:36.870
Exactly!

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:39.460
We will grind your
evil plans into dust!

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.000
To the stadium, then.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.400
You will battle these three first.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.980
Are you sure?
Just three of 'em?

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:08.360
It'd save us time if you
all fought us together.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:13.240
These three are Beybladers with
considerable positions in the BEGA League.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.580
I wouldn't underestimate them.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.040
Let's get this over with.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.630
Begin the countdown.

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.300
Three! Two! One!

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:27.340
Go, Shoot!

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.220
Here we go! This is the
power of the BEGA League!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:39.520
Falborg! Send these
small fries packing!

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:45.110
Time to show our power!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.610
Don't underestimate
the BEGA League!

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.820
Impressive.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:54.280
Nothing less from the runner up
team in the world championships.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.830
I don't have time
to deal with you.

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.580
Don't hold back!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:00.500
What?!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.880
Our pleasure!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.880
Ocean Scissors!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:06.090
Poison Tail!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.420
Tube Riding!

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.900
Is that all you've got?

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.160
Now it's our turn!

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.210
Go, Seaborg!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.580
Falborg!

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:44.210
Oh, crap! Run for it!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:47.590
There's nowhere to run!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.590
Stramolyu!

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:55.010
Stroblitz!

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.810
This is the end!

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.400
Novae Rog!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:18.240
The natural result from
Bladers I trained myself.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:22.080
No, I'd say they've come
a long way since then.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:33.130
We've been training for the day
to bring an end to your plans!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:37.470
Even entering the world championships
was all for this very moment!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.850
I don't think
they like you.

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:41.680
Just what did
you do to them?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.730
Do you need to know?

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:44.810
Nope.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:50.400
Who you are and what you
did is none of my business.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:51.650
Precisely.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:57.070
If we don't stop them,
the BEGA League is finished.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:09.710
I will face you next!

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:18.600
Is it right to just...

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.350
Leave Yuriy and
his team alone?

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.310
I know how
they feel, though.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:28.900
I bet they didn't want us to see them take revenge on Volkov.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.190
Even so...

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.110
Listen to my gut, huh...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.700
Takao?

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.070
Oh, there he is! Takao!

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.700
Oh, you're from before.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.450
Daichi! Max!

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.120
Please sign with us!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.540
Man, you guys are a pain!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:51.340
I don't care about your suppon!
We've got bigger issues to worry about!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.460
Daichi! How could you
say that to them?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.880
Shaddup!

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:58.430
Who cares about the suppon?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:01.470
It's not like it'll
make me stronger!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.310
It won't make you stronger...

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:06.810
You're right, Daichi!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.230
That's it!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:13.730
We got so hung up on frilly
words like pros and sponsors!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:15.110
Takao!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:18.740
It's not like any of that
would change us, anyway...

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.410
Yuriy...

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.200
Let's go! To see Yuriy!

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.580
Takao...

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.080
Okay, Takao!

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.370
Yeah!

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.880
Takao...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.720
Hope he's better
than your little cronies.

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.390
Absolutely.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:48.810
If you're able to defeat him, you're free
to do away with the BEGA League.

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:49.970
What?!

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:55.940
Does Volkov have that
much trust in this Blader?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.780
No do-overs,
you got that?

00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:03.120
You have my word,
but on one condition.

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:09.040
If he beats the three of you,
you'll all have to join BEGA.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.500
T-that's crazy!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.210
Absolutely not!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:17.550
I'd rather die than
work with you again!

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:19.090
Well, well...

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:22.140
If that's your response,
I have nothing left to say.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.930
Too bad.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:25.430
I'm up.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.350
Yuriy...

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:27.850
No.

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:30.310
You've shown me
what you can do.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.230
That's not fair.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.980
This time, I'll show
you what I can do.

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:38.240
First off, I'll battle
against you two.

00:19:38.490 --> 00:19:40.780
I'll even let you
team up on me.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.030
What'd you say?!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.950
I'd had enough
of your sass!

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:47.120
We don't need two to
battle against you! Let's go!

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.040
I accept.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.250
Go, Shoot!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:00.340
But how?!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.720
I can't believe that
Boris' attack had no effect!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:10.850
Sergey!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.980
We have to win,
no matter what!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.940
Go, Shoot!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:20.320
Here we go, Boris!

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:21.110
Right!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.110
Yuriy!

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:25.490
Look at that!

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.040
Stramolyu!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.370
Stroblitz!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.410
Watch and learn.

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.280
This is my power!

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:46.930
Radiant...

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.460
Thunder!!

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:16.210
Is this...
His power?!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.620
Is the TV broadcast ready?

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:24.580
Now then.
You're next, Yuriy Ivanov.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:28.470
Now we can
have a fair battle.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.180
Why you...

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:58.190
Yuriy and BEGA begin their battle!

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:04.440
But Garland's strength is
far beyond my data!

00:23:04.440 --> 00:23:06.820
We never imagined it'd
be so one-sided!

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
And Yuriy, how could you...!

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:12.370
This is awful...
What the hell is this?!

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:14.160
It's just too far!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:16.500
If this keeps up,
Yuriy will... Yuriy will...!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:22.330
Get real, Volkov!
Is this what you call a pro battle?!
